    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mascot horror game where you wield a rubber chicken as a flashlight, modifying it with strange energies to solve puzzles. Restore power, explore the twisted remains of Sunshine Farms, and whatever you do, don\u2019t let Squawky catch you. <br><br><u><strong>ANNA (Player Character)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a 9-year-old child who gets lost in a cornfield and ends up at the residence of the owners of Sunshine Farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SUNSHINE FARMS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunshine Farms is going out of business. They were known for hosting pumpkin patch events, growing corn, and manufacturing rubber Squawky chicken toys. They also created the &quot;Squawk-O-Matic&quot; machine, which can modify your rubber chicken toy by adding various energies such as light, fire, water, electricity, and earth.<br><br><u><strong>SQUAWKY</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squawky is a lab experiment gone wrong. Its creators took advantage of the failed experiment and began profiting from people's curiosity to see Squawky. As a result, Squawky became increasingly hostile toward people and ultimately caused Sunshine Farms to go bankrupt. DON\u2019T GET CAUGHT BY SQUAWKY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>RUBBER CHICKEN TOY</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.poster.avif?t=1754717636\" width=750 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.webm?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.mp4?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rubber chicken lights up when squeezed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.poster.avif?t=1754717636\" width=750 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.webm?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.mp4?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your rubber chicken with different energies by using the &quot;Squawk-O-Matic&quot; machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>BRING ELECTRICITY BACK TO THE FARM</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/2c387167d9908bc13b7b845c9b66bba6.poster.avif?t=1754717636\" width=750 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/2c387167d9908bc13b7b845c9b66bba6.webm?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/2c387167d9908bc13b7b845c9b66bba6.mp4?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to restore electricity to the farm so you can power up the &quot;Squawk-O-Genesis&quot; machine, eliminate Squawky, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mascot horror game where you wield a rubber chicken as a flashlight, modifying it with strange energies to solve puzzles. Restore power, explore the twisted remains of Sunshine Farms, and whatever you do, don\u2019t let Squawky catch you. <br><br><u><strong>ANNA (Player Character)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a 9-year-old child who gets lost in a cornfield and ends up at the residence of the owners of Sunshine Farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SUNSHINE FARMS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunshine Farms is going out of business. They were known for hosting pumpkin patch events, growing corn, and manufacturing rubber Squawky chicken toys. They also created the &quot;Squawk-O-Matic&quot; machine, which can modify your rubber chicken toy by adding various energies such as light, fire, water, electricity, and earth.<br><br><u><strong>SQUAWKY</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squawky is a lab experiment gone wrong. Its creators took advantage of the failed experiment and began profiting from people's curiosity to see Squawky. As a result, Squawky became increasingly hostile toward people and ultimately caused Sunshine Farms to go bankrupt. DON\u2019T GET CAUGHT BY SQUAWKY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>RUBBER CHICKEN TOY</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.poster.avif?t=1754717636\" width=750 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.webm?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/618ab5f806db8bf2507694e195aa6a41.mp4?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rubber chicken lights up when squeezed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.poster.avif?t=1754717636\" width=750 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.webm?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/34fdaf0ff6b303d06bb6b4b2865f946f.mp4?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your rubber chicken with different energies by using the &quot;Squawk-O-Matic&quot; machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>BRING ELECTRICITY BACK TO THE FARM</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/2c387167d9908bc13b7b845c9b66bba6.poster.avif?t=1754717636\" width=750 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/2c387167d9908bc13b7b845c9b66bba6.webm?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516220/extras/2c387167d9908bc13b7b845c9b66bba6.mp4?t=1754717636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to restore electricity to the farm so you can power up the &quot;Squawk-O-Genesis&quot; machine, eliminate Squawky, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
